Dashboards: pages the owner keeps in the sidebar and comes back to (a streak, a reading list). Only that becomes a page; a one-off answer or this conversation's progress stays a card. create drafts one with a preview card here; it shows only once the owner taps Keep there, so end the turn after create. update replaces the whole View, as view_update (a version conflict: get first). A tap on the page comes back here as the owner's message with persona-action view -pages/pg_…: answer by updating the page. Link to to-dos and Needs you; never copy their numbers. After the owner paused the page or restored a version, ask before changing it. get gives the page and its last taps; list the pages you write (the main conversation also reads the others'); a kept title gives error exists and its id.

タイトル、理由、完了条件、メッセージなど、新たに生成するユーザー向けの引数は、ユーザーが別の言語を求める場合や元の表現が必要な項目を除き、日本語で書いてください。引用した原文、識別子、ツール名と引数名、列挙値、コマンドの接頭辞はそのまま保持してください。言語によって承認要件や権限の範囲が変わることはありません。

{"type":"object","required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","update","get","list","remove"]},"id":{"type":"string","description":"update/get/remove: the pg_ id"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":40,"description":"create: the sidebar name in the owner's words; not a built-in place"},"icon":{"type":"string","description":"create: e.g. chart, list, calendar, heart"},"why":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"description":"create: one sentence the owner sees: why this page"},"view":{"type":"object","description":"create/update: the whole page as a View, as for view_show; reply, open (https), push.page, pop; no html or image"},"version":{"type":"integer","description":"update: the version you read"},"note":{"type":"string","maxLength":120,"description":"update: one line of history"},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"description":"remove: why, for the owner"}}}
